 * step list does. `data-kp-trace-verdict` `mark` or `word` shows one of the two (both by default; never colour alone).
 * Empty, failed and running are the package's plates and busy card, each as high as the trace was.
 * Knobs [KT6]: --kp-trace-gap (the space between hops, 1.5rem), --kp-trace-min (the least width of a hop, 9rem). */
    .kp-trace {
