       drawn by `filter` on the list (a clip on the strip's pseudo-element cuts the notch, a filter
       sees what is cut). Opening is this, closing the same four poses the other way, held until
       the script hides the list (js/components.js). */
    @keyframes kp-sig-cyberpunk-split-bar {
        0% {
            filter: drop-shadow(6px 4px 0 var(--accent)) drop-shadow(6px -4px 0 var(--primary));
            text-shadow:
