       the gold frame draws itself round from the middle of its top edge both
       ways and meets at the bottom (320 ms), then the lacquer and the words
       come up (160 ms), kp-sig-deco-arrive, 480 ms; the close is that
       backwards: the lacquer sinks, the frame undraws.

