    /* The plates inside a plate: a menu in a popover, a card in a dialog are
       the lacquer of the plate they stand on, not a second one. A menu that a
       menu button opens is a plate of its own wherever the button stands (a
       dialog's footer, a popover): it keeps its lacquer and inlay
       (2026-10-15: the review dialog's menus showed bare words), the
