           sinks, the inlay undraws), under the arrival's own name, so
           js/motion.js also lets it arrive as that leave turned round: its
           space unfolds as it arrives and folds as it leaves, one picture
           mirrored (lessons 19, 24; forest's toast does the same). The class
           is doubled to outweigh the arrival's list, whose `dialog.kp-drawer[open]`
           gives it (0,3,1). */
        [data-theme='deco'] .kp-toast.kp-toast[data-kp-leaving] {
            animation: kp-sig-deco-arrive var(--kp-sig-deco-arrive) linear reverse forwards;
        }

        [data-theme='deco'] :is(.kp-card, .kp-kpi, .kp-alert, .kp-empty, .kp-grid__tile):is([data-kp-leaving], [data-kp-arriving])::before,
        [data-theme='deco'] :is(.kp-card, .kp-kpi, .kp-alert, .kp-empty, .kp-grid__tile):is([data-kp-leaving], [data-kp-arriving])::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            inset: -1px;
            z-index: 5;
            visibility: visible;
            pointer-events: none;
            opacity: var(--kp-sig-deco-v);
            background-repeat: no-repeat;
            mask-composite: intersect;
        }

        /* The satin field: pleats of the lobby's blue, 12 degrees apart, a
           shade and a sheen in each, lace dots of gold along them; the
           guard sticks at both edges of the fan, gold lit from the top; the
           pivot's two upper facets. */
        [data-theme='deco'] :is(.kp-card, .kp-kpi, .kp-alert, .kp-empty, .kp-grid__tile):is([data-kp-leaving], [data-kp-arriving])::before {
            background-image:
                linear-gradient(to bottom right, transparent 50%, var(--kp-sig-deco-gold-lt) 50%),
                linear-gradient(to bottom left, transparent 50%, var(--primary) 50%),
                conic-gradient(
                    from -90deg at 50% 100%,
                    transparent calc(var(--kp-sig-deco-a1) - 1deg),
                    var(--kp-sig-deco-gold-hi) calc(var(--kp-sig-deco-a1) - 1deg),
                    var(--primary) calc(var(--kp-sig-deco-a1) + 0.4deg),
                    var(--kp-sig-deco-gold-lo) calc(var(--kp-sig-deco-a1) + 1.4deg),
                    transparent calc(var(--kp-sig-deco-a1) + 1.4deg) calc(var(--kp-sig-deco-a2) - 1.4deg),
                    var(--kp-sig-deco-gold-lo) calc(var(--kp-sig-deco-a2) - 1.4deg),
                    var(--primary) calc(var(--kp-sig-deco-a2) - 0.4deg),
                    var(--kp-sig-deco-gold-hi) calc(var(--kp-sig-deco-a2) + 1deg),
                    transparent calc(var(--kp-sig-deco-a2) + 1deg)
                ),
                radial-gradient(circle 0.7px, var(--kp-sig-deco-gold-lt), transparent),
                repeating-conic-gradient(
                    from -90deg at 50% 100%,
                    var(--kp-sig-deco-velvet-lo) 0deg,
                    hsl(from var(--kp-sig-deco-velvet) h s calc(l - 3)) 6deg,
                    var(--kp-sig-deco-velvet-lo) 12deg
                );
            background-position:
                calc(50% - 6px) 100%,
                calc(50% + 6px) 100%,
                0 0,
                0 0,
                0 0;
            background-size:
                6px 6px,
                6px 6px,
                100% 100%,
                6px 6px,
                100% 100%;
            background-repeat: no-repeat, no-repeat, no-repeat, repeat, no-repeat;
            mask-image: conic-gradient(
                from -90deg at 50% 100%,
                transparent calc(var(--kp-sig-deco-a1) - 1deg),
                var(--foreground) calc(var(--kp-sig-deco-a1) - 1deg) calc(var(--kp-sig-deco-a2) + 1deg),
                transparent calc(var(--kp-sig-deco-a2) + 1deg)
