/* ── The ideas and the recipe components, in this theme [kpadopt4-ideas, kpadopt4-recipes] ──
   Plates of the lobby (a timer, a countdown, a code block, a terminal, the compare frame) take the lacquer, the coves and
   the double inlay; a time out is one gilded flare, never a loop that shouts (G9); a handle is the lozenge jewel (G19);
   emerald marks what is included, ruby what is left out (G5); a wheel settles as a hand opens a fan (G1) inside a double
   gold rim; a step comes up with the lacquer (G3). Poiret One capitals name, Josefin counts (G18). */
@layer kp.signature {
    /* Typed confirmation. */
    [data-theme='deco'] .kp-type-confirm__loses {
        padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
        text-align: start;
    }
    [data-theme='deco'] .kp-type-confirm__loses-title {
        color: hsl(from var(--destructive) h s calc(l + 4));
        font-size: 0.8125rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.12em;
