    /* The surface [surface, G7]: a plate is a part on the sheet, not a box on
       it. No fill and no closed frame: the sheet and its ruled grid show through,
       and the plate stands on the graticule's two axes, a ruler along its start
       edge and another along its foot, a short tick every 8 px and a long one every
       40 in the line the finished lines are drawn in. The frame's 1 px stays, in
