/* ── The count that is still being counted is a hatched place [G16, t56-eye-1018] ──
   The line skeleton's two dimension ticks and baseline, drawn on the toggle's 2-character bone, read as an empty box with a
   stray stroke. The hatch is a section waiting: the bone is a small hatched section between its two ticks. */
@layer kp.signature {
