/* ── end flows and records: timeline ── */

/* ── Flows and records [kpadopt4]: the journey ── */
@layer kp.register {
    /* Formal: a journey is a ruled path through the ledger. The steps stand on no plate and under no hairline (the step list's
       ledger lines are for a list, not a path); the rule into a reached step is ruled in navy (G5: navy does every acting),
       or in the step's own colour, square-ended (G6); a step to come is joined by the faint ledger line (G7). The step it
       stands at is framed by the double rule, round (G7, G12: a hairline ring with a thinner ring inside it); a closed path
       ends in red ink (G5, G8). Names are labels in small capitals, dates in tabular figures (G18). */
