/* ── toggle button [kpadopt6-ops] ──
   The anchor: the double rule. A press draws the two rules for as long as the finger is down; a toggle that stays
   pressed keeps them drawn, and the underline stays under its label, so "on" is a ruled line and not a colour alone. */
@layer kp.register {
    [data-theme='formal'] .kp-button[data-kp-toggle][aria-pressed='true']::after,
