       it ran under the hint too, and the label's rule sat on the hint's capitals. The rule moves onto the label (as a key
       figure rules its label), keeps the button's colour and its fade, and a gap as wide as the rule's reach below the
       words keeps it off the hint; the gap comes out of the room over and under the pair, so the button keeps its size. */
    [data-theme='formal'] .kp-button[data-kp-toggle]:has(> .kp-toggle__hint) {
